flowchart TB
  MASTER[FigCraft master / native references + shared tokens] --> SPLIT[Assign screen batches and exclusive files]
  SPLIT --> CUSTOMER[Customer owner / implement + self-check]
  SPLIT --> RIDER[Rider owner / implement + self-check]
  SPLIT --> POS[POS owner / implement + self-check]
  CUSTOMER --> CAPTURE[Local rendered views / compare geometry + navigation]
  RIDER --> CAPTURE
  POS --> CAPTURE
  RESOURCE[Shared AVD and same-package builds / scheduled ownership] -. coordinates .-> CAPTURE
  CAPTURE --> REVIEW[Independent review at batch boundary]
  REVIEW --> RESULT{Scoped evidence passes?}
  RESULT -->|No| FIX[Fix identified mismatch / affected checks only]
  FIX --> CAPTURE
  RESULT -->|Yes| LEDGER[Update exact screen and state acceptance]
  LEDGER --> MORE{UI batches still open?}
  MORE -->|Yes| SPLIT
  MORE -->|No| JOIN[Remaining API joins and end-to-end acceptance]
  WAIT[Provider error / quota wait] --> USAGE[Fresh registered-account usage / no login secrets]
  USAGE --> GUARD[Same goal + session / positive pause-origin or safe-idle evidence]
  GUARD -->|Authorized recovery| SPLIT
  GUARD -->|Origin unknown| HOLD[Fail closed / human resume needed]
  LOCAL[LOCAL ONLY / no push or deployment] -. applies to all .-> SPLIT
